I have a small plugin that works with Obsidian. It can explain selected text in obsidian notes using ai and create a new note based on the generated explanation of the selected text (or append to existing one).   I am also interested in another problem: how to recursively dive into why using AI for a claim in obsidian.   how to extend the plugin to do this? or I should develop a new plugin?

