The user-facing service may create, list, read, fork/handoff, title, pin, archive, start/steer/interrupt turns, and otherwise manage threads allowed by normal environment authorization.

The existing `ThreadControlService` is the starting point. Refactor its durable orchestration and provider-confirmation behavior away from voice-only action/binding types so voice, UI, automations, and agent trees can share it.

#### Model-visible agent-tree facade

