- provider session/runtime instance;
- immutable control generation/epoch;
- allowed operations;
- provider/model allowlist;
- maximum runtime mode;
- depth, child-count, concurrent-turn, response-size, and wait limits.

The facade may manage permitted descendants in its tree. It must not enumerate or mutate arbitrary user threads.

